Z||000018||FIEROCIOUS||03-13-2000||11:19 PM||||I just bought the springs and KYBs a month ago! Does Koni make a shorter travel strut for the Fiero? How much are they? What route should I go? I want the coilovers so I can fit wider tires in back, but if they don't sit in the perch I would rather keep the Eibachs. I also think the Eibach rear springs are too progressive and would rather a linear rate spring. I guess I could start all over and get suspenstion techniques springs. Other members say they sit in their perch! Do they? <BR>Are there any other options I haven't thought of?||||reg||8
